<title>NEW ZEALAND: Countrywide Bank cuts NZ fixed rates.</title>
<headline>Countrywide Bank cuts NZ fixed rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Countrywide Bank on Friday said it had cut its one year fixed mortgage rate to 10.25 percent from 10.5 percent and its two-year fixed rate to 9.75 percent from 9.9 percent effective from October 29.</p>
<p>The bank said the cuts reflect the fall in wholesale rates.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
